{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02964","headline":"奉和圣制谒玄元皇帝庙斋 · 张九龄","name":"奉和圣制谒玄元皇帝庙斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兴运昔有感，建祠北山巅。\n云雷初缔构，日月今悠然。\n紫气尚蓊郁，玄元如在焉。\n迨兹事追远，轮奂复增鲜。\n洞府香林处，斋坛清汉边。\n吾君乃尊祖，夙驾此留连。\n乐动人神会，钟成律度圆。\n笙歌下鸾鹤，芝术萃灵仙。\n曾是福黎庶，岂唯味虚玄。\n赓歌徒有作，微薄谢昭宣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02964.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02964","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}